.INDENT 3.0
.IP 1. 3
Item 2, Item 2, Item 1
.IP 2. 3
Item 2, Item 2, Item 2
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SS Testing ordered lists and auto\-numbering w/ note directive
.sp
\fBNote:\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.INDENT 0.0
.IP 1. 3
Item 1
.INDENT 3.0
.IP 1. 3
Item 1, nested under 1
.sp
\fBNote:\fP
.INDENT 3.0
.INDENT 3.5
